2. Contact before rent-a-car business use

Any rent-a-car company wishing to apply or deploy the Software in its business
must contact Renato Pinto before operational use, including use of an
unmodified copy. This also applies when a contractor deploys it on behalf of
such a company. Identify the company and describe the intended application
and any required adaptations. Local exploration and evaluation are permitted
without prior contact.

This is a contact requirement, not a requirement to wait for approval. This
license does not impose a fee for the company's own internal use. Paid
development, support or other services require a separate agreement.

3. Notification of adaptations

Anyone making an adaptation must inform Renato Pinto of the changes and their
intended use. Provide a brief description when making the adaptation and
notify the author again of subsequent adaptations. A GitHub issue or pull
request describing the adaptation satisfies this requirement. You do not
need to submit your modified source code or wait for approval.

4. Contact channel

Submit a usage or adaptation notice at:
https://github.com/quebranozes/rena-rent-a-car/issues/new?template=usage-notification.md

An alternative contact channel expressly provided by the author may also be
used. Keep public notices free of confidential business or personal records.

